title: Snowman_Act1
---
Mr. Snowman: ...
Mr. Snowman: ...
Mr. Snowman: ...
Mr. Snowman: Hello! I'm Mr. Snowman!
Mr. Snowman: I haven't had the pleasure of speaking to someone in years!
Mr. Snowman: I must inquire with you...
Mr. Snowman: Is it a little warm in here or is that just me?
-> Now that you mention it...
    Mr. Snowman: I fear for my safety, friend.
    Mr. Snowman: For each year is warmer than the last.
    Mr. Snowman: How many more will pass 'till I am simply a puddle on this mountain?
-> Nah I don't think so
    Mr. Snowman: Ah, apologies.
    Mr. Snowman: I guess I'll just melt all by my lonesome...
===

title: Snowman_Act2
---
Mr. Snowman: ...
Mr. Snowman: Melt, melt, melting...
===

title: Snowman_Act3
---
Mr. Snowman: ...
Mr. Snowman: Am I drooping? Do I look soggy?
Mr. Snowman: Be honest.
-> Yes.
    Mr. Snowman: I need to start thinking of what to put in my will.
    Mr. Snowman: And who can write it.
    Mr. Snowman: I don't have thumbs.
-> No.
    Mr. Snowman: Oh thank goodness. I got some time in my left.
===

title: Snowman_Act4
---
Mr. Snowman: ...
Mr. Snowman: I heard what happened. No one tends to notice I'm there, anyways.
Mr. Snowman: I'll miss the idea of artifical snow, it would've prolonged my life.
Mr. Snowman: But I guess the water and energy cost is too high to bear.
Mr. Snowman: Besides, it's not the only option, even if its not all bad. 
Mr. Snowman: Oh, well. I'll see you next winter, in theory.
===
